---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base title="devfreddy — Michael Frederick">
  <section class="hero shell">
    <h1>I'm Michael. I work on AI&nbsp;systems at LangChain.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Deployed architect on the professional services team. I work with customer
      engineering teams building agents, mostly the LangSmith side of it: traces, evals,
      the work between a promising demo and something you'd actually ship. It's a good
      time to be doing this.
    </p>
    <p class="prior dim">
      Before this I was at Apollo, on GraphQL federation, which is the problem of getting
      a pile of separate APIs to behave like one. Before that, New Relic, one of the
      companies that made watching your software run in production a normal thing to do.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 6.5rem) 0;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    max-width: 24ch;
    margin-block: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 54ch;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* The backstory is context, not the pitch, so it sits a step down. */
  .prior {
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }
</style>
